# backend.tf.example
#
# Phase 5 stub. This is the reusable template that OTHER repos (e.g.
# azure-data-tier-lab, azure-dr-lab) copy into themselves as `backend.tf`
# to point their own Terraform state at the infrastructure this repo
# creates.
#
# It will contain a `terraform { backend "azurerm" {} }` block with the
# resource group / storage account / container from this repo's outputs,
# plus a per-project `key` (state file blob name).
#
# Full content + usage instructions written in Phase 5.
